    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Fine 3 Bed Mid Terrace Residence In Quiet and Mature Cul-De-Sac\n\nThe sale of 16 Ashgrove, Castlehyde Park, offers buyers the opportunity to acquire a well-appointed home in a quiet and mature cul-de-sac, ideally suited to those in search of their first home. Extending to approximately 90 sq. m, the thoughtfully designed accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, living room with open fire and a spacious kitchen/dining room overlooking the south-facing rear garden and guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, the main bedroom with en-suite shower room, together with a family bathroom. Outside, the property benefits from off-street parking and a secure, south-facing rear garden. Castlehyde Park is conveniently located close to the amenities of Rosbercon, the South East Greenway and New Ross town centre. The nearby N25 also provides excellent connectivity to Waterford City and Wexford. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 5.3m x 2m with tiled floor \n\nLivingroom 4.4m x 3.2m with open fire\n\nKitchen 3.7m x 3.2m with range of fitted units and tiled floor \n\nDining area 2.8m x 2.2m with patio doors to rear garden\n\nGuest w.c. \n\nFirst floor \n\nBedroom 1. 3.6m x 3.4m plus en-suite 2.4m x 0.8m\n\nBedroom 2. 3.8m x 2.6m \n\nBedroom 3. 2.7m x 2.5m\n\nBathroom 2.2m x 1.7m \n \nOUTSIDE: Off street parking to the front and south facing rear garden\nSERVICES: O.F.C.H. all other main services \nBER: B\nEIRCODE: Y34CP86\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
      },
